&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To find answers for each customer, Workhelix applies our unmatched expertise in economics, AI, and data science. We have pioneered a task-scoring method to identify top GenAI opportunities, ensuring clear, data-driven deployment strategies. Our ROI monitoring suite applies Nobel Prize-winning economics to provide accurate, ongoing insights into the impact of GenAI implementations. Renowned AI and Economics thinkers including Andrew Ng, and cofounders Andy McAfee and Erik Brynjolfsson stand proudly behind our mission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We maintain a culture established on five key principles. For more information on our leadership principles, please visit the careers page of our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for our first dedicated Business Development Representative, supporting a team of four Account Executives. This is an execution-focused role: cold email, cold calling, and outbound prospecting into our Tier 2 and Tier 3 accounts. You&#39;ll work closely with Marketing on sequencing and automation and own CRM hygiene across HubSpot and Attio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the first person in this seat, there&#39;s no existing BDR playbook to inherit. You&#39;ll be building your own cadence and operating rhythm from the ground up while staying aligned with how our AEs work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run disciplined, multi-channel outbound (cold call, cold email, LinkedIn) into assigned Tier 2 and Tier 3 accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research accounts and contacts to prioritize the right prospects and develop relevant outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing on outbound sequencing and campaign cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own CRM data hygiene across HubSpot and Attio as a standing habit, not a cleanup task.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify and hand off well-briefed meetings to AEs, with the context they need to run an effective first call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle objections in live conversations and adjust messaging based on what&#39;s working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and use your own activity and conversion metrics to improve performance over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Workhelix&#39;s outreach with integrity, avoiding misrepresentation as you scale multi-channel sequences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication.&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate clearly, concisely, and persuasively in writing and on calls, adapting your message to the audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Execution.&lt;/strong&gt; You take responsibility for outcomes, follow through on commitments, and proactively figure out what&#39;s next without needing constant direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive &amp;amp; Persistence.&lt;/strong&gt; You sustain effort and stay resilient through rejection, setbacks, and repetitive work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning Agility.&lt;/strong&gt; You absorb new information, product knowledge, and feedback quickly and apply it to new situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intellectual Curiosity &amp;amp; Discovery.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re genuinely curious about customers, companies, and problems, and you ask thoughtful questions instead of just executing a script.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coachability &amp;amp; Adaptability.&lt;/strong&gt; You seek out feedback, apply it, and adjust quickly as priorities or processes change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospecting &amp;amp; Pipeline Generation.&lt;/strong&gt; You identify and prioritize the right prospects and execute disciplined outreach that generates qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Process &amp;amp; Operational Discipline.&lt;/strong&gt; You manage activity systematically, keep CRM data accurate, use sales tools effectively, and let metrics guide your prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Business Acumen.&lt;/strong&gt; You pick up technical, AI-driven products quickly and connect their capabilities to customer problems and outcomes, without leaning on unnecessary jargon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 years of outbound BDR/SDR experience, ideally in B2B SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-activity, high-organization approach, comfortable owning a structured cadence across cold call, email, and LinkedIn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with CRM tooling - CRM hygiene is a natural habit for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating with ambiguity as the first person in the role, with no existing playbook to lean on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration instincts, especially around handoff quality with AEs, since a well-qualified, well-briefed meeting is as much of the job as booking it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise or complex-sale exposure, given Workhelix&#39;s Fortune 2000 buyer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career ambition toward an AE path, since this seat is often a funnel into that role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Attio and HubSpot (CRM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;First 30 days:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete onboarding on Workhelix&#39;s product, ICP, and value proposition (task-scoring methodology, ROI monitoring suite) well enough to explain it without jargon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get fluent in HubSpot and Attio; audit and clean existing Tier 2/3 account and contact data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shadow AEs on calls to understand what a well-qualified handoff looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build initial account and contact lists for assigned Tier 2/3 territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch first outbound sequences (cold call, email, LinkedIn) in partnership with Marketing&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By 60 days:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running a consistent, disciplined outbound cadence across all three channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM hygiene is a steady habit, data stays clean in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling common objections confidently and adjusting messaging based on what&#39;s converting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting a defined activity target (calls/emails/LinkedIn touches per week)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering consistently well-briefed handoffs that AEs rate as high quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking personal conversion metrics and using them to refine prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Book first qualified meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By 90 days:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully ramped: Meet a defined activity target numbers that are agreed upon by the BDR and manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the emerging BDR playbook; cadence, messaging, and process others could follow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identifying which segments/messages within Tier 2/3 are working best and reallocating effort accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear line of sight toward AE-path development goals&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Base salary 105-140K + Commission &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;+ Equity + Health Benefits&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package and benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Chance to learn and collaborate with some of the most famous researchers in the AI and digital economy space: Andrew Ng, Erik Brynjolfsson, Andy McAfee, and Daniel Rock.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The unique opportunity to help build a company, culture, and products from the ground up with a team that values healthy working practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A high-trust, high-autonomy work environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Workhelix, we stand committed to ensuring an environment of mutual respect where equal employment opportunities are available without any discrimination. We believe diversity is critical to our success. Selection for employment will solely be based on qualifications, merit, and business needs. We encourage all qualified individuals to apply!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Workhelix is an enterprise SaaS company with a single goal: helping organizations get the most out of their AI investments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our people and software combine to give leaders answers to the three critical questions about the business value of AI:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Where are our top opportunities to create value with AI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Are our current efforts actually delivering? What’s their ROI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;How can we accelerate and increase the benefits of our AI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To find answers for each customer, Workhelix applies our unmatched expertise in economics, AI, and data science. We have pioneered a task-scoring method to identify top GenAI opportunities, ensuring clear, data-driven deployment strategies. Our ROI monitoring suite applies Nobel Prize-winning economics to provide accurate, ongoing insights into the impact of GenAI implementations. Renowned AI and Economics thinkers including Andrew Ng, and cofounders Andy McAfee and Erik Brynjolfsson stand proudly behind our mission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We maintain a culture established on five key principles. For more information on our leadership principles, please visit the careers page of our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Product Engineer to join our team and help us scale reliably as we grow. As we add customers, we want to make sure our team&#39;s ability to build great new features never gets compromised. This role exists to protect that focus: by strengthening how we catch and resolve issues, and by building the infrastructure that keeps quality high as we scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across our FastAPI (Python) / Postgres / React stack, touching everything from schema design to UI behavior to CI pipelines. This is a high-trust, high-autonomy role for someone who wants real ownership early in their career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage and resolve incoming customer bugs across single-tenant staging and production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside the team to design and build new features and capabilities on our main product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build automated test suites that scale across customer environments without becoming their own maintenance burden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the full stack (Python/FastAPI backend, Postgres, React frontend) to understand and fix issues at their root cause, not just their symptom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical thinkers who thrive in ambiguous environments and approach challenges with curiosity and rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-centric mindset with a passion for translating complex data into software-led actionable strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team players with low ego and a strong desire to contribute to meaningful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive learners who adapt quickly and can guide, lead, and collaborate effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicators who can engage with stakeholders at every level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional full-stack engineering experience; comfort with Python and React strongly preferred, but we&#39;re open to strong candidates from other OOP backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real SQL fluency. You understand schema design, and you can reason about ingestion to transformation to output pipelines, and the difference between a clean and a messy data model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems mindset. You naturally zoom out and notice when something upstream or downstream of your own work is drifting out of sync&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias toward pragmatic delivery. You scope before you dive in, break work into shippable increments, and ship at the pace a fast-moving company requires without over-engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine product and user judgment. You care what the user actually experiences, and you&#39;ll question a ticket that looks wrong rather than build it as written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low ego, high standards. You care more about the quality of the outcome than who gets credit, and you take feedback in review without getting defensive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaborative instincts and async communication. You loop people in early, and you write clearly in Slack, PRs, and EOD updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine intellectual curiosity. You&#39;re energized rather than destabilized when priorities shift, and you go deep on problems because you can&#39;t help it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in the First 90 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 30 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become familiar with the product, architecture, and development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute through bug fixes, backlog items, and smaller enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to the FastAPI, PostgreSQL, and React stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully navigate the team&#39;s development, review, and deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build confidence deploying to staging and production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 60 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of clearly scoped portions of active product initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver work that integrates effectively with broader team efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate increasing independence and technical judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deeper understanding of customer needs and product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 90 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as a fully integrated member of the engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently deliver meaningful product and engineering work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute across a variety of product areas based on team priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance feature development, maintenance work, and customer-driven needs with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently deliver work within the team&#39;s normal development cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay range and compensation package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;$115,000- $150,000 + Equity + Health Benefits&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package and benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Chance to learn and collaborate with some of the most famous researchers in the AI and digital economy space: Andrew Ng, Erik Brynjolfsson, Andy McAfee, and Daniel Rock.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The unique opportunity to help build a company, culture, and products from the ground up with a team that values healthy working practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A high-trust, high-autonomy work environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Workhelix, we stand committed to ensuring an environment of mutual respect where equal employment opportunities are available without any discrimination. We believe diversity is critical to our success. Selection for employment will solely be based on qualifications, merit, and business needs. We encourage all qualified individuals to apply!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Workhelix is an enterprise SaaS company with a single goal: helping organizations get the most out of their AI investments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our people and software combine to give leaders answers to the three critical questions about the business value of AI:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Where are our top opportunities to create value with AI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Are our current efforts actually delivering? What’s their ROI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;How can we accelerate and increase the benefits of our AI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To find answers for each customer, Workhelix applies our unmatched expertise in economics, AI, and data science. We have pioneered a task-scoring method to identify top GenAI opportunities, ensuring clear, data-driven deployment strategies. Our ROI monitoring suite applies Nobel Prize-winning economics to provide accurate, ongoing insights into the impact of GenAI implementations. Renowned AI and Economics thinkers including Andrew Ng, and cofounders Andy McAfee and Erik Brynjolfsson stand proudly behind our mission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We maintain a culture established on five key principles. For more information on our leadership principles, please visit the careers page of our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Workhelix, the Senior Consultant is pivotal in transforming complex business challenges into actionable solutions. You&#39;ll be the bridge between customer needs, data insights, and service execution, ensuring that organizations can make better, faster, and smarter decisions with our expertise. This role combines analytical problem-solving, deep user empathy, and strategic execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage deeply with customers to understand their strategic goals, operational challenges, and data landscapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify critical workflows and data sources that drive AI adoption and business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build quantified business cases that connect Workhelix insights to measurable customer outcomes - giving client executives a clear, defensible case for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead client workstreams with our Engineering and Product teams to design and deploy scalable, customized solutions that meet client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead customer onboarding and enablement sessions to the Workhelix Nucleus platform to ensure adoption and empower users to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present data-driven insights and strategic recommendations to client executives, ensuring alignment on value realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to influence product enhancements based on field insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope new and expansion engagement opportunities and assess how Workhelix can drive transformation across diverse industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales colleagues to continuously deliver value for the customer and grow the ACV for Workhelix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution by running SteerCo meetings, managing agendas, documenting decisions, and sharing clear follow-ups to keep projects on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structure to ambiguous environments by organizing workstreams, maintaining alignment across stakeholders, and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical thinkers who can hold their own with data and engineering teams and who know how to translate a finding into something an executive can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric problem solvers who dig past what a client explicitly asks for to understand &lt;em&gt;what they actually need,&lt;/em&gt; and who bring structure to messy, ambiguous situations without being told what to look for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product-minded, even without the title. You have a strong sense of what&#39;s worth building and can prioritize customer requests in a way that keeps trust intact, even when the answer is no.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outcome-driven people. You don&#39;t stop at the insight,&amp;nbsp; you translate it into a quantified business case that gives a customer&#39;s leadership a concrete reason to act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-ego and highly accountable people. When something goes wrong in front of a client, you own it, fix it, and move on rather than pointing to the work you did.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive learners who get up to speed in unfamiliar domains without waiting to be taught, and who find shifting scope energizing rather than destabilizing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural relationship builders across functions. You can align engineering, data science, product, and sales toward a shared outcome without having formal authority over any of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People comfortable driving change without direct authority. You can diagnose why adoption is stalling inside a client organization and create pull rather than waiting for someone to ask.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builders of process, not just followers of it. You&#39;re comfortable designing an operating rhythm from scratch: agendas, documentation, follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicators who read a room and adjust instinctively, whether it&#39;s a Head of Engineering, a CIO, or a CFO on the other side of the table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous individuals. You catch the small thing in a deliverable or a follow-up email before it becomes the client&#39;s reason to lose confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in client-facing roles, particularly in strategy, consulting, SaaS customer-facing environments (e.g., customer success, implementation, or professional services), or similar, with experience coordinating internal engineering and data science teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to deliver results in complex organizational environments like B2B enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building quantified business cases, or a demonstrated ability to pick this up quickly, translating an insight into something a customer&#39;s finance or executive stakeholders will act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating complex data ecosystems and identifying insights that drive business value. You don&#39;t need to be a SQL or Python practitioner, but you need to think quantitatively and know how to credibly translate into customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing novel, software-led solutions to drive business outcomes for enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving adoption and behavior change with stakeholders you don&#39;t formally manage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication, with the ability to shift register across technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ad-hoc data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel (up to ~25%) as required by client and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in or willing to relocate to the San Francisco Bay Area for in-office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working SQL proficiency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in an early-stage, high-growth SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling internal processes from scratch in an ambiguous org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with SaaS sales teams and a history of recognizing expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
