&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the Workhelix product and methodology and can confidently answer common customer questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how we engage customers across pilot and pull engagements, including how Senior Consultants collaborate with Sales, Product, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how Workhelix creates value for customers and can clearly articulate our value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
