&lt;li&gt;You are identifying meaningful product signals from customers and bringing those insights back to Product and Sales while advocating for customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can tell a compelling, data-driven story to customer stakeholders at multiple levels—from managers and directors to the C-suite—and clearly articulate the value Workhelix is delivering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By 90 days:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
