&lt;li&gt;You are identifying and deploying novel solutions that help customers get more value from their AI investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactively identifying opportunities for additional value and engaging customers in expansion and renewal conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
